  "description": "A bonsai\u2019s life, told slowly: an ens\u014d is brushed onto the wall and a seed falls into the pot, then the tree grows year by year in one of six classic styles, through blossom, full leaf, autumn colour and bare winter branches under snow. A gardener prunes it each summer, a bird visits, incense curls by a stone lantern, and in time it returns to mist.",
